架是通过硅酸盐和铝酸盐物种之间的聚缩合反应形成的。具体而言，它由SiO4和AlO4四面体通过氧桥连接组成，并含有K+、Na+或Ca2+等阳离子来平衡四配位铝（AlIV）所产生的负电荷，形成经验公式为Mn[(SiO2)z-AlO2]n·wH2O的结构。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '311fd6d3-7616-4c46-948d-015861db6a53', 'content': '问题: 地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？\n答案: A：地聚物是一种无机化合物，可在接近环境温度下固化形成具有耐高温和强度的低碳陶瓷材料。其优点包括相对较高的强度、弹性模量和低收缩性，并且可以替代传统水泥，具有环保效益。然而，其主要缺点是像大多数陶瓷材料一样容易发生脆性断裂。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？...', 'score': 0.7749759, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物是一种无机化合物，可在接近环境温度下固化形成具有耐高温和强度的低碳陶瓷材料。其优点包括相对较高的强度、弹性模量和低收缩性，并且可以替代传统水泥，具有环保效益。然而，其主要缺点是像大多数陶瓷材料一样容易发生脆性断裂。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition spec