2025-08-04 10:14:43 | INFO     | api.endpoints.qa:generate_sse:465 - [KNOWLEDGE_DEBUG] 接收到knowledge_sources事件: {'type': 'knowledge_sources', 'data': {'knowledge_sources': [{'id': '15dbe42f-0d54-44a2-86f8-9a4daf257b41', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中的基本定义是什么？与传统波特兰水泥相比，其主要优势体现在哪些方面？\n答案: A：地聚合物是一种无水泥胶凝材料，通过碱性试剂活化富含铝硅酸盐的工业废弃物（如粉煤灰和矿渣）而制成。与传统波特兰水泥（OPC）生产相比，地聚合物的制造可将碳排放量降低约50%至80%，显著减少温室气体排放，是更可持续的建筑材料选择。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中的基本定义是什么？与传统波特兰水泥相比，其主要优势体现在...', 'score': 1.0, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': 'e08fbe68-ff06-4fa7-a085-dc3f6447bbf0', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中是如何定义的？它作为一种新型胶凝材料，其基本组成和形成机制是怎样的？\n答案: A：地聚合物通常被定义为碱激活的铝硅酸盐材料。它是由两个主要组分组成的无机体系：一是富含SiO2和Al2O3的反应性固体源（如粉煤灰、矿渣等工业副产品）；二是碱激活溶液。地聚合物的形成机制涉及这些组分在碱性环境下发生聚合反应，通过SiO4和AlO4四面体单元共享氧原子连接起来，并由水合碱阳离子平衡电荷，最终形成无定形的胶凝材料。这种材料被视为一种绿色可持续的替代传统水泥的胶凝材料。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中是如何定义的？它作为一种新型胶凝材料，其基本组成和形成机...', 'score': 1.0, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': 'e8b1b796-92ee-41bb-9326-e4334cda6904', 'content': '问题: 地聚物材料的基本结构特性是什么？其三维骨架是如何形成的？\n答案: A：地聚物是一种无定形至半结晶的聚合物，其核心结构由硅-氧-铝骨架构成。该三维骨架是通过硅酸盐和铝酸盐物种之间的聚缩合反应形成的。具体而言，它由SiO4和AlO4四面体通过氧桥连接组成，并含有K+、Na+或Ca2+等阳离子来平衡四配位铝（AlIV）所产生的负电荷，形成经验公式为Mn[(SiO2)z-AlO2]n·wH2O的结构。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物材料的基本结构特性是什么？其三维骨架是如何形成的？...', 'score': 0.7792882000000001, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物材料的基本结构特性是什么？其三维骨架是如何形成的？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物是一种无定形至半结晶的聚合物，其核心结构由硅-氧-铝骨架构成。该三维骨架是通过硅酸盐和铝酸盐物种之间的聚缩合反应形成的。具体而言，它由SiO4和AlO4四面体通过氧桥连接组成，并含有K+、Na+或Ca2+等阳离子来平衡四配位铝（AlIV）所产生的负电荷，形成经验公式为Mn[(SiO2)z-AlO2]n·wH2O的结构。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': 'ea4bf4af-a10d-497e-bb43-5992dda98f9f', 'content': '问题: 地聚物化反应的基本原理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？\n答案: A：地聚物化是一种无机聚合过程，通过碱性活化铝硅酸盐材料实现。在高浓度的碱性氢氧化物或硅酸盐溶液中，铝硅酸盐会发生溶解、缩聚和重排反应，形成具有无定形或半结晶聚合物结构的稳定材料。这些结构以相互连接的Si-O-Al-O-Si键为特征，构成了地聚物体系的胶凝基质。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物化反应的基本原理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？...', 'score': 0.7686955, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物化反应的基本原理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物化是一种无机聚合过程，通过碱性活化铝硅酸盐材料实现。在高浓度的碱性氢氧化物或硅酸盐溶液中，铝硅酸盐会发生溶解、缩聚和重排反应，形成具有无定形或半结晶聚合物结构的稳定材料。这些结构以相互连接的Si-O-Al-O-Si键为特征，构成了地聚物体系的胶凝基质。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\n![0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg](images/0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg)', 'title': '', 'score': 0.05, 'source_type': 'document', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'extra': None, 'headings': [], 'strategy': 'semantic', 'page_number': [1], 'dual_vector_metadata': "{'general_text': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\\\mathrm{\\\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\\\mathrm{{mass}}\\\\% {\\\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\\n![0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg](images/0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg)', 'domain_text': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\\\mathrm{\\\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\\\mathrm{{mass}}\\\\% {\\\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition s', 'original_tokens': 539, 'general_tokens': 539, 'domain_tokens': 421, 'text_adapted': True, 'tokenizer_used': 'matbert_tokenizer_for_domain'}"}, 'highlights': {'content': ['Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而<mark>定</mark>。']}, 'adopted': True}], 'knowledge_stats': {'total_sources': 5, 'source_types': {'qa_dataset': 4, 'document': 1}, 'average_score': 0.7195967399999998, 'search_time': 0.0}, 'agent_name': 'cailiao_