理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？\n答案: A：地聚物化是一种无机聚合过程，通过碱性活化铝硅酸盐材料实现。在高浓度的碱性氢氧化物或硅酸盐溶液中，铝硅酸盐会发生溶解、缩聚和重排反应，形成具有无定形或半结晶聚合物结构的稳定材料。这些结构以相互连接的Si-O-Al-O-Si键为特征，构成了地聚物体系的胶凝基质。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物化反应的基本原理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？...', 'score': 0.7686955, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物化反应的基本原理是什么？它是如何形成稳定材料的？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物化是一种无机聚合过程，通过碱性活化铝硅酸盐材料实现。在高浓度的碱性氢氧化物或硅酸盐溶液中，铝硅酸盐会发生溶解、缩聚和重排反应，形成具有无定形或半结晶聚合物结构的稳定材料。这些结构以相互连接的Si-O-Al-O-Si键为特征，构成了地聚物体系的胶凝基质。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\