体的交联单元组成，形成无定形铝硅酸盐材料。这些四面体通过共享氧原子形成三维网络结构。为了平衡AlO4-单元中的负电荷，碱金属阳离子（如Li+、Na+、K+和Cs+）充当电荷平衡离子。地聚物的形成过程涉及铝硅酸盐矿物（如偏高岭土或粉煤灰）与高腐蚀性碱性水溶液（MOH，其中M为碱金属阳离子）的反应，从而在环境温度下水热硬化。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物材料在化学上是如何构成以及其形成机制是什么？这些构成元素如何平衡电荷？...', 'score': 0.7913821999999999, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物材料在化学上是如何构成以及其形成机制是什么？这些构成元素如何平衡电荷？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物在化学上由AlO4-和SiO4四面体的交联单元组成，形成无定形铝硅酸盐材料。这些四面体通过共享氧原子形成三维网络结构。为了平衡AlO4-单元中的负电荷，碱金属阳离子（如Li+、Na+、K+和Cs+）充当电荷平衡离子。地聚物的形成过程涉及铝硅酸盐矿物（如偏高岭土或粉煤灰）与高腐蚀性碱性水溶液（MOH，其中M为碱金属阳离子）的反应，从而在环境温度下水热硬化。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $