2025-08-04 13:57:42 | INFO     | api.endpoints.qa:generate_sse:471 - [KNOWLEDGE_DEBUG] 收集到的具体团队知识来源: [{'id': 'e08fbe68-ff06-4fa7-a085-dc3f6447bbf0', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中是如何定义的？它作为一种新型胶凝材料，其基本组成和形成机制是怎样的？\n答案: A：地聚合物通常被定义为碱激活的铝硅酸盐材料。它是由两个主要组分组成的无机体系：一是富含SiO2和Al2O3的反应性固体源（如粉煤灰、矿渣等工业副产品）；二是碱激活溶液。地聚合物的形成机制涉及这些组分在碱性环境下发生聚合反应，通过SiO4和AlO4四面体单元共享氧原子连接起来，并由水合碱阳离子平衡电荷，最终形成无定形的胶凝材料。这种材料被视为一种绿色可持续的替代传统水泥的胶凝材料。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中是如何定义的？它作为一种新型胶凝材料，其基本组成和形成机...', 'score': 1.0, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '15dbe42f-0d54-44a2-86f8-9a4daf257b41', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中的基本定义是什么？与传统波特兰水泥相比，其主要优势体现在哪些方面？\n答案: A：地聚合物是一种无水泥胶凝材料，通过碱性试剂活化富含铝硅酸盐的工业废弃物（如粉煤灰和矿渣）而制成。与传统波特兰水泥（OPC）生产相比，地聚合物的制造可将碳排放量降低约50%至80%，显著减少温室气体排放，是更可持续的建筑材料选择。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物（geopolymer）在材料科学中的基本定义是什么？与传统波特兰水泥相比，其主要优势体现在...', 'score': 1.0, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '311fd6d3-7616-4c46-948d-015861db6a53', 'content': '问题: 地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？\n答案: A：地聚物是一种无机化合物，可在接近环境温度下固化形成具有耐高温和强度的低碳陶瓷材料。其优点包括相对较高的强度、弹性模量和低收缩性，并且可以替代传统水泥，具有环保效益。然而，其主要缺点是像大多数陶瓷材料一样容易发生脆性断裂。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？...', 'score': 0.7934052, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物作为一种材料，其主要的优点和缺点是什么？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物是一种无机化合物，可在接近环境温度下固化形成具有耐高温和强度的低碳陶瓷材料。其优点包括相对较高的强度、弹性模量和低收缩性，并且可以替代传统水泥，具有环保效益。然而，其主要缺点是像大多数陶瓷材料一样容易发生脆性断裂。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '5be3fea7-a35d-43c1-b39f-816edbc34234', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物材料的本质特性及其在哪些方面展现出优异性能？\n答案: A：地聚合物是由铝硅酸盐源（如偏高岭土）在碱性溶液激活下，于环境温度下合成的无机非晶态三维铝硅酸盐材料。它们具有优异的耐酸性和耐火性，可作为替代传统波特兰水泥的环保型胶凝材料，并在放射性废物管理等特定应用中因其无机、抗径向弯曲和各向异性机械应力、以及长期机械稳定性等特性而被研究。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物材料的本质特性及其在哪些方面展现出优异性能？...', 'score': 0.7868101999999999, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚合物材料的本质特性及其在哪些方面展现出优异性能？', 'answer': 'A：地聚合物是由铝硅酸盐源（如偏高岭土）在碱性溶液激活下，于环境温度下合成的无机非晶态三维铝硅酸盐材料。它们具有优异的耐酸性和耐火性，可作为替代传统波特兰水泥的环保型胶凝材料，并在放射性废物管理等特定应用中因其无机、抗径向弯曲和各向异性机械应力、以及长期机械稳定性等特性而被研究。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\n![0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg](images/0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg)', 'title': '', 'score': 0.05, 'source_type': 'document', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'extra': None, 'headings': [], 'strategy': 'semantic', 'page_number': [1], 'dual_vector_metadata': "{'general_text': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\\\mathrm{\\\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\\\mathrm{{mass}}\\\\% {\\\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\\n![0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg](i